  "job_B19.5_20251003_114444": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Herasmis tid, se w\u00e6s biscop on Antiochia JU02A3 He w\u00e6s f\u00e6ger on ansyne ond \u00e6nlic, ond his eagan w\u00e6ron swelce sunnan leoma. JU02A4 \u00d0a on \u00f0a tid bebead Dioclitianus se casere \u00f0\u00e6t cristne men guldan deofolgeldum. JU02A6 \u00d0a gewat se biscop on westen ond \u00fe\u00e6r eardade seofon gear, ond him \u00fe\u00e6r b\u00e6r hr\u00e6fn mete JU02A9 \u00d0a com him godes engel to ond hine al\u00e6dde \u00f0anon on Italia m\u00e6g\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t is on Etelwara JU02A12 \u00d0\u00e6r he awehte deadne mon of dea\u00f0e, ond \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t wundor eall \u00f0\u00e6t folc onfeng fullwihte. JU02A14 \u00d0a het Maximianus se casere hine l\u00e6dan to his deofolgelde, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6m gulde. JU02A16 \u00dea stod \u00fe\u00e6r gyldenu onlicnes, twelf elna heah, ond of \u00fe\u00e6re com gan micel draca ond abat JU02A19 \u00dea het se casere hine don on carcern. JU02A20 \u00dea \u00e6t midre niht \u00e6tywde hine Michahel se heahengel ond hine ut al\u00e6dde of \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre, JU02A25 \u00d0\u00e6r he gereste seofon dagas, ond \u00fe\u00e6r com stefn of heofonum ond hine cede to \u00fe\u00e6re ecan JU02A27 \u00d0a b\u00e6d he god \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwelc mon \u00fee him geb\u00e6de on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00f0\u00e6r his eardung w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t JU02A31 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe seo stefn eft of heofonum,",
